1785867118180340	edict-dev	itc:v3:AWLkkmTOfzk5kQAAAAAAQeqtbv7rtAAAAAEvKg		item.create	bn-mal0	{"description":"The responder's no-prefix triage classifier (handle_triage in src/commands/responder.rs) hardcodes model 'haiku', which AGENTS.md documents as the default responder behavior ('no prefix -> haiku triage'). Switch it to openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna (already used in this project's [models].fast tier in .edict.toml) as the new default triage model. Update AGENTS.md's two references to 'haiku triage' for the no-prefix path to match; leave the explicit !qq haiku route and the worker.model example untouched, since those are unrelated.","kind":"task","title":"responder: switch default triage model from haiku to gpt-5.6-luna"}	blake3:nTNwGyDn1axqUV3DukEAKbyBojuHzqSB8Y2N7ceBWpU
