1786547710068523	edict-dev	itc:v3:AWLkkmTOfzk5kQAAAAAAQeqtbv7rtAAAAAEvRg		item.create	bn-7hby	{"description":"sync has ensure_reviewer_hooks but no equivalent for the router/responder hook. If the hook is deleted, or was registered under a since-renamed project name, sync leaves the project with no responder and prints nothing. Found on rite, seal (project.name=botseal) and vessel, whose legacy botbus/botcrit/botty hooks disappeared.","kind":"bug","title":"edict sync cannot restore a missing responder hook"}	blake3:yRdAqVhWlFTHQ-miuTuj9vln7IOryF78VxllFIMHxJk
